%% Provenance de modelos: navegable en AMBOS sentidos (F7 §25, obligatorio)
flowchart TD
    DS[Dataset<br/>dataset_id + version + split] --> EXP[ModelExperiment<br/>EXP-ANOM-001]
    EXP --> TR[TrainingRun<br/>config + seed + git_commit + hardware]
    TR --> M[Model version<br/>ModelRegistryEntry: estado + capacidades]
    M --> MAN[Model Manifest<br/>checksum + features + umbral + runtime]
    MAN --> INF[ModelInference<br/>score + threshold + latency + executed_at]
    INF --> AN[DetectedAnomaly<br/>window/event scope]
    AN --> RUN[AgentRun<br/>llm_model + prompt_version + memory_mode]
    RUN --> CASE[DiagnosticCase<br/>hipótesis + evidencias + provenance_id]
    CASE -. ProvenanceRecord: vuelta completa hasta el RAW .-> DS
